{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "decd7025",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Preprocessing for NSL-KDD:\n",
    "1. Load train/test, split features vs label\n",
    "2. Create binary label (normal vs attack) for later evaluation\n",
    "3. One-hot encode categorical columns (protocol_type, service, flag)\n",
    "4. Align train/test columns (test may have categories train doesn't, or vice versa)\n",
    "5. Scale numeric features with StandardScaler\n",
    "6. Save processed arrays + labels to outputs/ for reuse in later notebooks"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "59611db3",
