       "            components_: ndarray of shape (n_components, n_features)<br><br>Principal axes in feature space, representing the directions of<br>maximum variance in the data. Equivalently, the right singular<br>vectors of the centered input data, parallel to its eigenvectors.<br>The components are sorted by decreasing ``explained_variance_``.</span>\n",
